EntityPainting.attackEntityFrom`). Not done: fireballs are not pushed. Fireball: `Strike::Tnt` became `Strike::Falling`: a falling sand / gravel block stops a fireball like a lit TNT (both are `canBeCollidedWith`; `Entity.attackEntityFrom` only marks it hit).
